# 🚀 [v3.0.0] — CORE REBUILD UPDATE
📅 2026-06-10

## 🔧 SYSTEM CHANGES

- Core engine fully rebuilt from previous architecture
- Event-driven system upgraded to modular async pipeline
- Command execution flow optimized for lower latency
- Memory handling improved for low-end device stability
- Multi-session support reinforced and stabilized

---

## ⚙️ ENGINE IMPROVEMENTS

- Response system optimized (faster execution cycle)
- Error handling rewritten with auto-recovery layer
- Crash protection upgraded with multi-layer validation shield
- Command parser upgraded to fast routing logic
- Module loader redesigned for dynamic injection support

---

## 🤖 AI SYSTEM UPDATE

- Context handling improved (longer conversation stability)
- Response generation made more natural and adaptive
- Fallback engine added for failed responses
- Reduced latency in AI processing pipeline

---

## 🎨 UI / MENU SYSTEM

- Menu system upgraded to autoMenuV3
- Layout redesigned into structured grid system
- UI style refined (dark cyber anime minimal fusion)
- Banner system upgraded to auto-generation engine
- Navigation speed improved (fast select system)

---

## 📥 MEDIA SYSTEM

- Sticker engine upgraded (HD conversion pipeline)
- Video processing optimized via ffmpeg tuning
- Image processing enhanced (auto quality normalization)
- Format support stabilized (jpg, png, mp4, gif, webp)

---

## 📡 DOWNLOAD SYSTEM

- Multi-platform support added:
  - TikTok
  - Instagram
  - YouTube
  - Facebook

- Fetch engine optimized (fast routing system)
- Auto fallback endpoints implemented
- Retry mechanism stabilized

---

## 🧬 SECURITY UPDATE

- Anti-spam system upgraded (adaptive detection logic)
- Anti-crash system improved (payload filtering)
- Injection protection strengthened
- Session guard system stabilized (multi-session safe sync)

---

## 🧩 MODULE SYSTEM

- AutoMenuV3 engine integrated
- AI chat core stabilized
- Media downloader engine optimized
- Group tools system improved
- Session manager upgraded to v2 stable
- Command parser optimized for speed

---

## 📊 PERFORMANCE UPDATE

- Boot time improved significantly
- RAM usage reduced (lightweight optimization layer)
- Response time reduced (0.2s–0.8s average)
- Group stability increased under heavy load
- Error rate reduced near minimum threshold
- Uptime improved to production stability level

---

## 🧯 BUG FIXES

- Fixed undefined command error
- Fixed sticker conversion failure cases
- Fixed menu rendering delay issue
- Fixed JSON parsing errors in unstable inputs
- Fixed spam crash loop in group messages
- Fixed media download failure fallback logic
- Fixed slow response under high group traffic

